vilan mysteeri. Soluttaudu, etsi todistusaineistoa, \u00e4l\u00e4k\u00e4 miss\u00e4\u00e4n nimess\u00e4 j\u00e4\u00e4 kiinni. \n\nPeli on tehty yhteisty\u00f6ss\u00e4 Metropolian kolmannen vuoden opiskelijoiden ja Ylen kanssa. \n\nLue lis\u00e4\u00e4: \nhttps://yle.fi/aihe/historia/kieltolaki \nhttp://gamesblogs.metropolia.fi/salakapakka/", "short_description": "Astu 1920-luvun Helsinkiin ja k\u00e4y tutkimaan salaper\u00e4ist\u00e4 mysteerikahvilaa."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3092869367412511", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162702_760613700793011_4081331521003192320_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jJRepI8RRY4Q7kNvwHSNeTm&_nc_oc=Adl61lkQPK9toeVG6CcZRXwMLQC_FZWRkL3QszTfMZtHtuPWFkBrvim7ZTpLHNefJhE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyU5-BkxvRiwncjtPluI32rVw0TWT6GyHE2nKIgIqZS-Q&oe=69AC2254"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "3052622228115034", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/12386286_555864938090815_4744680728720048128_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Jgf-xL0FgZcQ7kNvwGcBtoi&_nc_oc=AdmMOCA7auPp10ZLEqxDMMs2Uu8ZXBHSZJ_d7fSzJHrAtNjUy0G5dW3VMga0BEzDE6Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afxbj7BlmcGx5dUMnR5m9dSBARIgPTsdQgiYx5V0LtIEAw&oe=69AC2732"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "635734543935653", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162754_583536608704930_1984236639773261824_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hRyXJe-mMmUQ7kNvwHTG9G9&_nc_oc=AdmU4XPVMQ70v9vKXiEU0yymQ9Ikij4TVchoeMb0eAK1bEd5ErYvi3T7VnbwQuXakXk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afw-5RpBr7RUZnYANLYRSAIfF3wF0f0kFfrhAh-ax39KJA&oe=69AC34D5"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "614292642460347", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "